{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PCVR Horror Shooter Game</strong> with a Medieval Setting. Clear out monsters in different areas, collect artifacts and solve puzzles to summon boss fights. Play minigames to unlock new weapons. Collect loot drops to increase your abilities in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Abilities: </strong>Speed Boost - Invincibility Shield - Time Dilation<strong>\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up ability loot drops to enhance your combat abilities. Speed boost increases your max run speed for a limited time. Shield protects you from damage for a limited time. Use Time Dilation to slow time, highlight enemies in the area and it gives you the ability to steal fallen enemy weapons.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/LootDrops.jpg?t=1744653470\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weapons: </strong>Pistol, Shotgun, Rifle,</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/Weapons.jpg?t=1744653470\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enemies:</strong> Pumpkin Spider - Freddy Pumpkin - Mutants - Zombie - Vampires - Skeletons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/Enemies.jpg?t=1744653470\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bosses: Mushroom Monster - Mutant - Reaper - Spyder Queen - Ancient One</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/extras/Bosses.jpg?t=1744653470\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3531950?t=1744653470","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531950/page_b